  "id": "self-insight",
  "term": "self-insight",
  "definition": "Self-insight is a person’s awareness and understanding of their own subjective experiences, including their thoughts, feelings, and related mental processes. People differ in how much self-insight they have, and higher self-insight is linked in this source to richer understanding of words for abstract and emotional experiences.",
